OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for strangling partner
OL,4,Aduring assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who strangled his partner until
OL,7,Fshe struggled to breathe before
OL,8,Fsubjecting her to a relentless campaign
OL,9,Fof calls and messages has been jailed
OL,10,Ffor two years and 10 months.
OL,12,FCallum Ellis, 26, from Lincoln,
OL,13,Fadmitted grabbing his partner's throat
OL,14,Fon three occasions during a sustained
OL,15,Fassault.
OL,17,FLincoln Crown Court heard the final
OL,18,Fincident lasted for about 30 seconds
OL,19,Fand left the victim with a bump on her
OL,20,Fhead after she was slammed against a
OL,21,Fwall.
